    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61899" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάξις</span></b>  (not <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾶξις</span></b> ), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαχεῖν</span>) 
